Dil Ko Karaar Aaya Guitar Chords with strumming pattern sung by Neha Kakkar and Yasser Desai from album Sukoon.

Strumming Pattern: DD UUU DUDU,        Play only Downstork when lyrics is slow.

Capo on 1st Fret (Buy Capo)

